flowchart TD
  accTitle: The gate at a glance
  accDescr: Trusted manifest and checkout inputs must exist. Missing inputs produce an infrastructure failure; available inputs select documentation and owned checks and produce a JSON verdict.
  A["Trusted manifest and checkout"] --> B{"Inputs available?"}
  B -->|"No"| C["Infrastructure failure"]
  B -->|"Yes"| D["Docs, setup and unit checks"]
  D --> E["Registered E2E if full mode"]
  E --> F["JSON verdict and exit status"]
